sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as bor-agent
    participant PS as PolicyServer<br/>(policy port, mTLS)
    participant Hub as PolicyHub
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    actor Admin

    Agent->>PS: SubscribePolicyUpdates(last_known_revision)
    PS->>PS: identity = verified certificate CN
    alt revision 0 or ahead of server
        PS->>DB: released policies with enabled bindings for node groups
        PS-->>Agent: SNAPSHOT x N (last one snapshot_complete)
    else behind and delta available, no resync events
        Note over PS,Hub: not reached today - only resync events are published
        PS->>Hub: EventsSince(revision)
        PS-->>Agent: CREATED / UPDATED / DELETED events
    else behind, delta compacted or contains a resync
        PS-->>Agent: full SNAPSHOT
    end
    PS->>DB: node status = online
    Note over PS,Hub: watch mode, Subscribe(clientID)
    Admin->>Hub: policy or binding change -> PublishResync(groupIDs)
    Hub->>DB: SaveRevision (high-water mark)
    Hub-->>PS: resync signal
    PS-->>Agent: full SNAPSHOT if node groups overlap
    Agent->>PS: ReportCompliance per policy
    Note over Agent,PS: stream breaks -> node offline
    Agent->>Agent: wait backoff (1s, 2s, 4s ... max 60s)
    Agent->>PS: SubscribePolicyUpdates(last revision seen)
